	(text "J601: 1 M-, 2 encoder VCC, 3 A, 4 B, 5 GND, 6 M+ (MG310, D-028).  C603 DNP: fit at the motor if needed.\nU601 at the connector, pass-through routing.  The third buffer input is grounded: ENC_L_Z reads low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "191bde0f-e8c0-50b5-8dce-fc321ef81410")
	)
	(text "Per channel: ESD at the connector -> 2.2k open-collector pull-up (DNP, for open-collector encoders)\n-> 100 Ohm + 1 nF: f_c 1.59 MHz > 2 x 105 kHz max channel rate, rise 220 ns\n-> SN74LVC3G17 Schmitt buffer at 3V3: V_T+ <= 1.87 V, 5.5 V tolerant inputs with I_off (SCES470D)\n-> LPTIM1 (left) / TIM2 (right) encoder inputs.\nThe MG310 has no index: the third input is grounded, PC5 / PC3 read low (D-028).\nLayout: MOT_x away from every ENC_* trace on all layers (docs/power-map.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "483f49b5-76c7-5a1b-92fb-5f6f884f0eba")
	)
	(text "Encoder supply (D-016)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "787af073-1ea9-5cbb-8e17-4e40f8a1830f")
	)
	(text "J602: 1 M-, 2 encoder VCC, 3 A, 4 B, 5 GND, 6 M+ (MG310, D-028).  C607 DNP: fit at the motor if needed.\nU603 at the connector, pass-through routing.  The third buffer input is grounded: ENC_R_Z reads low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8b023603-294b-5b73-b7be-2f50a78944b1")
	)
	(text "Right MG310: motor + Hall encoder (J602)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aa20746e-07ee-533b-b0a2-ffd73b743626")
	)
	(text "Encoder input chain (D-012, docs/design-calcs.md)"
